#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:3
#: c5cdd699e1984b379841394cc9956fb1
msgid "条件替换（Conditional Replace）"
msgstr "Conditional Replace"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:5
#: 8d09f215b5c34e7c8a7fbefdfcb5b49a
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr "**Category:** Alloys and composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:7
#: b764b3c9ce714053a7d48bce76ca8b57
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:9
#: 9f25580760334f498052858d5ef2534f
msgid "条件替换会在每个输入结构中找到“指定元素且位于给定笛卡尔区域”的全部原子，再将这些位点分配给一个或多个替换元素。每个输入始终输出一个结构："
msgstr ""
"Conditional Replace finds every atom in each input structure that both has the "
"specified element and lies within a given Cartesian region, then assigns those sites "
"to one or more replacement elements. Every input always produces one output:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:11
#: 4dcf0087ffd548fc957337a9cbb52551
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{out}}=N_{\\mathrm{in}}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:15
#: 53d54225b95e424ca25cd1c00a4d16ff
msgid ""
"它适合表面钝化、界面局部改性和固定空间区域的元素替换。比例只控制多个替换元素如何瓜分命中位点，**不是替换率**；所有命中位点都会被替换。若要按浓度仅替换一部分位点，请使用随机掺杂（Random"
" Doping）。"
msgstr ""
"It is suited to surface passivation, local interface modification, and element "
"replacement within a fixed spatial region. Ratios control only how the matched sites "
"are divided among multiple replacement elements; they are **not a replacement "
"fraction**. Every matched site is replaced. Use Random Doping to replace only a "
"concentration-dependent subset of sites."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:17
#: 8a0c8db011ff40a68415f6609b3caa85
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:19
#: 74fc08cb025843e59a801c167605b9a5
msgid ""
"对原子 $i$，元素为 $Z_i$，当前笛卡尔坐标为 $\\mathbf r_i=(x_i,y_i,z_i)$。位置表达式定义布尔判据 $\\phi(\\mathbf "
"r_i)$，命中集合为"
msgstr ""
"For atom $i$, let its element be $Z_i$ and its current Cartesian coordinate be "
"$\\mathbf r_i=(x_i,y_i,z_i)$. The position expression defines a Boolean predicate "
"$\\phi(\\mathbf r_i)$, giving the matched set"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:21
#: 782aa9fdd94a4ab197a577ded72b82cc
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal I=\\{i\\mid Z_i=Z_{\\mathrm{target}}\\ \\text{且}\\ \\phi(\\mathbf "
"r_i)=\\mathrm{true}\\}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal I=\\{i\\mid Z_i=Z_{\\mathrm{target}}\\ \\text{ and }\\ \\phi(\\mathbf "
"r_i)=\\mathrm{true}\\}.\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:25
#: 889161175ce744849dbd3980574d554b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"表达式支持 `and`、`or`、比较和简单四则运算，例如 `z>=8 and z<=10`。这里的 X/Y/Z 是结构当前坐标原点下的**固定全局笛卡尔轴**，单位 "
"Å；程序不做周期最小镜像、坐标 wrap 或晶格 $a/b/c$ 转换。`==` 和 `!=` 的比较容差为 $10^{-4}$ Å。"
msgstr ""
"Expressions support `and`, `or`, comparisons, and simple arithmetic, for example "
"`z>=8 and z<=10`. Here X/Y/Z are **fixed global Cartesian axes** relative to the "
"structure's current coordinate origin, in Å. The program performs no periodic "
"minimum-image operation, coordinate wrapping, or conversion to lattice $a/b/c$. "
"Comparisons using `==` and `!=` have a tolerance of $10^{-4}$ Å."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:27
#: 2d140b1c6a0443ae83e3d2dcd4a168ca
msgid "设命中位点数为 $N=|\\mathcal I|$，正的相对权重归一化为"
msgstr ""
"Let the number of matched sites be $N=|\\mathcal I|$. Positive relative weights are "
"normalized as"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:29
#: cd75ebd1d709483c94c3bc4b184d0474
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"p_e=\\frac{w_e}{\\sum_j w_j}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:33
#: 708dcf1a1dc240dc87ab6cb94e2a3245
msgid "**独立随机分配**：每个位点独立按 $P(Z_i=e)=p_e$ 抽样，单个结构中的元素计数会涨落。"
msgstr ""
"**Independent random allocation:** sample every site independently according to "
"$P(Z_i=e)=p_e$, so element counts fluctuate within an individual structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:34
#: 438bf4f5be244ec08965da9dca8570ee
msgid ""
"**匹配整体比例**：先计算 $q_e=Np_e$，取 $\\lfloor q_e\\rfloor$，再把剩余位点依次分给小数余数最大的元素。因此总计数严格等于 "
"$N$，并尽量接近目标比例。"
msgstr ""
"**Match overall ratio:** first compute $q_e=Np_e$ and take $\\lfloor q_e\\rfloor$, "
"then assign remaining sites in descending order of fractional remainder. The total "
"count therefore equals $N$ exactly and is as close as possible to the target ratio."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:36
#: 6663ec601f2f42c29d6fce46fc61eff8
msgid ""
"程序只改变元素符号；原子数、positions、cell 和 PBC 保持不变。现有 `spin` 与 ASE `initial_magmoms` "
"也会按原位点原样保留。替换磁性元素后应检查或重新设置磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"The program changes only element symbols; atom count, positions, cell, and PBC remain"
" unchanged. Existing `spin` and ASE `initial_magmoms` are also preserved at their "
"original sites. Check or reset magnetic moments after replacing magnetic elements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:38
#: f9ac7ccba9314b3db1d33b21c93a70f8
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:40
#: 256001f210c34d7d91e6a3d50becffc4
msgid "一个表面结构中共有 10 个 O，其中 6 个满足 `z>=8 and z<=10`。设置："
msgstr "A surface structure contains ten O atoms, six of which satisfy `z>=8 and z<=10`. Set:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:42
#: 61fb1ee3b08f41f088dbfb7175bd37db
msgid ""
"目标元素：O\n"
"替换混合物：F:0.7, Cl:0.3\n"
"位置选择：z>=8 and z<=10\n"
"元素分配：匹配整体比例\n"
msgstr ""
"Target element: O\n"
"Replacement mixture: F:0.7, Cl:0.3\n"
"Position selection: z>=8 and z<=10\n"
"Element allocation: Match overall ratio\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:49
#: 74c443c7fe864817856ae55e644928a2
msgid ""
"程序只处理这 6 个 O。连续目标计数为 $6\\times(0.7,0.3)=(4.2,1.8)$，最大余数分配后得到 4 个 F 和 2 个 Cl；其他 4 个 O "
"不变。输出写入 `Repl(O->F,Cl)` 标签。"
msgstr ""
"The program processes only these six O atoms. The continuous target counts are "
"$6\\times(0.7,0.3)=(4.2,1.8)$; largest-remainder allocation gives four F and two Cl "
"atoms, while the other four O atoms remain unchanged. The output receives a "
"`Repl(O->F,Cl)` label."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:51
#: a36e8fe656b34ce2b5bdcc1dc7d38e53
msgid "如果训练集缺少表面 O 被卤素替换后的局域环境，可以用这张卡补充明确区域内的化学变化，再检查输出元素计数和命中坐标是否符合预期。结构弛豫与能量判断属于后续计算步骤。"
msgstr ""
"If the training set lacks local environments where surface O is replaced by halogens,"
" use this card to add chemical changes within an explicit region, then verify output "
"element counts and matched coordinates. Structural relaxation and energy assessment "
"belong to subsequent calculations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:53
#: d41663ef475446ad881663f3219c430e
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:55
#: a3893353f3934cf2b36c1120689b2d65
msgid "替换规则"
msgstr "Replacement Rule"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:57
#: 782aa23a6d694da8a0cc9b66aa3eaaf7
msgid "目标元素（target）"
msgstr "target"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:59
#: 9acb2136efca47cb92b2eee56e15f902
msgid "默认留空。请选择输入结构中实际存在的一个元素，例如 `O`、`Si` 或 `Fe`；输入中不存在该元素时会明确报错。"
msgstr ""
"Empty by default. Select one element that actually exists in the input structure, "
"such as `O`, `Si`, or `Fe`. An explicit error is reported if it is absent."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:61
#: 8839d6a5bf9a43c494d9f8061c5c3633
msgid "替换混合物（replacements）"
msgstr "Replacement Mixture (replacements)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:63
#: d92d3e50f25d4cf09efcb2ddae022e90
msgid ""
"默认留空。添加一个或多个替换元素及其非负相对权重，例如 "
"`F:0.7,Cl:0.3`。权重会自动归一化；零权重元素会被忽略，至少一个权重必须为正。同一元素不能重复，也不能包含目标元素本身。"
msgstr ""
"Empty by default. Add one or more replacement elements with nonnegative relative "
"weights, for example `F:0.7,Cl:0.3`. Weights are normalized automatically; zero-"
"weight elements are ignored, and at least one weight must be positive. Elements "
"cannot repeat and the target element itself cannot be included."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:65
#: a34a026d56a74677b600a577aadae602
msgid "笛卡尔区域"
msgstr "Cartesian Region"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:67
#: 6bd2878a82744b3aaa977f503c659b07
msgid "位置筛选（condition）"
msgstr "condition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:69
#: dafde6068a50453a8d9f4584744c41b2
msgid "默认 `all`，表示选择所有目标元素。界面也可构造一个 X/Y/Z 边界，或输入高级表达式。典型表达式："
msgstr ""
"Default `all`, selecting every atom of the target element. The interface can also "
"construct X/Y/Z bounds or accept an advanced expression. Typical expressions are:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:71
#: 3eed961bba7748a2b9d51b221308d998
msgid "`z>=8`：当前全局笛卡尔 Z 坐标不小于 8 Å；"
msgstr "`z>=8`: current global Cartesian Z coordinate is at least 8 Å;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:72
#: 41e8e8edb9284f6d9e4f345a9951876e
msgid "`z>=8 and z<=10`：8–10 Å 区间；"
msgstr "`z>=8 and z<=10`: the interval from 8 to 10 Å;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:73
#: a1b93d5de1b144ba90fa6e04ee514d63
msgid "`x>5 or y<2`：满足任一条件的位点。"
msgstr "`x>5 or y<2`: sites satisfying either condition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:75
#: 67469cc456b54be3aa2ebf149606a759
msgid "元素分配"
msgstr "Element Allocation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:77
#: c379f95874ab45a291d0e57adeaebe7d
msgid "分配方式（mode）"
msgstr "Allocation Mode (mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:79
#: a24b13a990514245992cf32a7b926e71
msgid "`0`：独立随机分配；"
msgstr "`0`: independent random allocation;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:80
#: 076c80316e374468bdc7d4e35130b22e
msgid "`1`：匹配整体比例，使用最大余数法确定整数计数。"
msgstr ""
"`1`: match the overall ratio, using the largest-remainder method to determine integer"
" counts."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:82
#: 4bf2d20bec77493cbe056655cb0b1731
msgid "两种方式都会替换全部命中位点。只有一个替换元素时结果相同。"
msgstr ""
"Both methods replace every matched site. Their results are identical when there is "
"only one replacement element."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:84
#: 78e1bb105dcc4fc2a38faad6f38a7df3
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:86
#: 69e0092c239a42768cac0e5304263903
msgid "默认 0，表示每次运行使用新的随机序列。正整数会固定命中位点与替换元素之间的随机对应关系；匹配整体比例时固定 seed 也会固定各元素落在哪些位点。"
msgstr ""
"Default 0, which uses a new random sequence on each run. A positive integer fixes the"
" random mapping between matched sites and replacement elements. In overall-ratio "
"mode, a fixed seed also fixes the sites receiving each element."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:88
#: f10abfb146594c90a1faba1420e15849
msgid "与相邻卡片的区别"
msgstr "Differences from Neighboring Cards"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: efbb7268f985458bb7ecf756a2143360
msgid "卡片"
msgstr "Card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: 58edeb837751431db2d56e40ff7eca08
msgid "选择依据"
msgstr "Selection Basis"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: 24bf2d7734e84247b0576079cb13c989
msgid "实际操作"
msgstr "Actual Operation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: d3c983d1a1224e0fb3d8ba2b3f286349
msgid "条件替换"
msgstr "Conditional Replace"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: cb3856ad087c43649d99d9be286cccd5
msgid "固定全局笛卡尔区域"
msgstr "Fixed global Cartesian region"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: 191275532fa54da8a90e5d19119e9078
msgid "指定元素的全部命中位点做单向替换"
msgstr "One-way replacement of all matched sites of a specified element"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: 00e1fa149ca945bd99e39a4ac5009916
msgid "随机掺杂"
msgstr "Random Doping"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: a480328fb6ff49a58b61fd39a232471d
msgid "数量、浓度或 group"
msgstr "Count, concentration, or group"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: 32c20caf946e4f49b5f29429766fd4fa
msgid "只替换部分候选位点，可生成多个样本"
msgstr "Replace only a subset of candidate sites and generate multiple samples"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: a51c9478feb04880ac4080c3bff6e0d2
msgid "成分梯度"
msgstr "Composition Gradient"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: 5bad1a494e5d41149df16c550e63b5f7
msgid "晶格分数坐标 $a/b/c$ 排序"
msgstr "Ordering by lattice fractional coordinate $a/b/c$"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: 96819e2df31c46e6bcf256d99f31a031
msgid "形成连续的空间成分过渡"
msgstr "Create a continuous spatial composition transition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: e79c1c110cbf41348ce60853ede1d22b
msgid "界面层混合"
msgstr "Interface Layer Mixing"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: b31a2d7bd42644548a316a3e34ab5871
msgid "界面两侧的晶格层"
msgstr "Lattice layers on both sides of an interface"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md
#: 4a1dac25a501459683cbc8ae33b2cb86
msgid "两侧元素做双向互混"
msgstr "Bidirectional mixing of elements on the two sides"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:97
#: e1c4c6511c5743368ae3bb40b9bcc194
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:99
#: 0a0f4e96a3234a2689f8d6acedd35f30
msgid "为什么提示没有命中原子？"
msgstr "Why Are No Matching Atoms Reported?"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:101
#: 833450cf91d44405bd90ea3ae0bb04f0
msgid "先确认目标元素存在，再检查结构的实际笛卡尔坐标范围。原子跨越周期边界时，本卡不会自动按最小镜像重组区域。"
msgstr ""
"First confirm that the target element exists, then inspect the structure's actual "
"Cartesian coordinate range. If atoms cross a periodic boundary, this card does not "
"automatically reconstruct the region using minimum images."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:103
#: f721d6db176d4e99afe342ee97e5265c
msgid "为什么比例不是保留原元素的比例？"
msgstr "Why Does the Ratio Not Describe How Much of the Original Element Is Retained?"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:105
#: 884f3a81a0c04b9698abf5550a8e462b
msgid "替换混合物只在新元素之间分配命中位点。若要保留一部分目标元素，请改用随机掺杂，而不要把目标元素写进替换混合物。"
msgstr ""
"The replacement mixture allocates matched sites only among new elements. To retain "
"part of the target element, use Random Doping instead of adding the target element to"
" the replacement mixture."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:107
#: 4bb3194ea3524a338f54e5517f882c0f
msgid "为什么替换后磁矩没有变化？"
msgstr "Why Are Magnetic Moments Unchanged after Replacement?"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:109
#: deb717db2d2c46b8825e338168742831
msgid "磁矩数组按位点原样保留，程序无法仅凭新元素可靠推断物理磁矩。请在下游连接磁矩设置或磁序卡片，或手工检查磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"Magnetic-moment arrays are preserved at their original sites, and the program cannot "
"reliably infer physical moments from the new elements alone. Connect Set Magnetic "
"Moments or Magnetic Order downstream, or inspect moments manually."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:111
#: 4c21c0e7fb8542c79f549d41fc1cc347
msgid "序列化示例"
msgstr "Serialization Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/conditional-replace-card.md:113
#: 299167622f704e9bafa38256d527bafc
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"target\": \"O\",\n"
"    \"replacements\": \"F:0.7,Cl:0.3\",\n"
"    \"condition\": \"z>=8 and z<=10\",\n"
"    \"seed\": 101,\n"
"    \"mode\": 1\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `ConditionalReplaceCard`"
#~ msgstr "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `ConditionalReplaceCard`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按空间坐标条件对指定元素做区域选择性替换。用 x/y/z 坐标表达式（如 `z>=8 and "
#~ "z<=10`）筛选候选位点，只替换命中区域内的原子，未命中区域保持原样。适合表面钝化、界面修饰、层状材料选择性改性等场景。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Replace a selected element only where a "
#~ "spatial-coordinate condition is true. Expressions "
#~ "such as `z>=8 and z<=10` select candidate "
#~ "sites; atoms outside the region remain "
#~ "unchanged. Use this for surface passivation, "
#~ "interface modification, or layer-selective "
#~ "chemistry."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "与 `Random Doping` 的区别：`Random Doping` 对全体 "
#~ "target 原子做无差别随机替换；`Conditional Replace` 先用坐标条件筛选位点，再在命中区域内做替换。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Unlike `Random Doping`, which samples all "
#~ "target atoms globally, `Conditional Replace` first"
#~ " restricts sites with a coordinate expression "
#~ "and replaces only within that region."

#~ msgid "`target` = `O`"
