#~ msgid ""
#~ "按空间坐标条件对指定元素做区域选择性替换。用笛卡尔 `x/y/z` 坐标表达式（如 `z>=8 and "
#~ "z<=10`）筛选候选位点；所有命中位点都会被替换，未命中区域保持原样。多个替换元素后面的比例只决定它们如何分配到命中位点，不表示“替换多少位点”。适合表面钝化、界面修饰、层状材料选择性改性等场景。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Perform region-selective replacement of specified"
#~ " elements using spatial conditions. Cartesian "
#~ "`x/y/z` expressions such as `z>=8 and z<=10`"
#~ " select candidate sites; every matching site "
#~ "is replaced while nonmatching regions remain "
#~ "unchanged. Ratios after multiple replacement "
#~ "elements determine only how replacements are "
#~ "assigned to matching sites, not how many "
#~ "sites are replaced. Use it for surface "
#~ "passivation, interface modification, and selective "
#~ "changes in layered materials."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "与 `Random Doping` 的区别：`Conditional Replace` "
#~ "用坐标表达式精确划定空间区域，输出一个结构并替换全部命中位点；`Random Doping` "
#~ "按数量或浓度做部分替位，可以生成多个结构，也可以读取 `Group Label` 写入的 group "
#~ "标签。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Difference from `Random Doping`: `Conditional "
#~ "Replace` defines a spatial region precisely "
#~ "with an expression, produces one structure, "
#~ "and replaces every matching site. `Random "
#~ "Doping` performs partial substitution by count "
#~ "or concentration, can generate multiple structures,"
#~ " and can read group labels written by "
#~ "`Group Label`."

