#~ msgid ""
#~ "其中 $k\\in\\{x,y,z\\}$，比较符可以是大于、小于或等于；等于判断使用固定 $10^{-4}$ Å "
#~ "容差。替换权重会归一化为概率 $p_e$。`精确`模式对 $|\\mathcal I|$ "
#~ "个位点使用最大余数法确定每种替换元素的整数计数；`随机`模式让每个位点 独立按类别分布 $P(Z_i=e)=p_e$ "
#~ "抽样。前者控制单个结构的计数，后者允许结构间产生组分涨落。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Here $k\\in\\{x,y,z\\}$, and comparisons may use "
#~ "greater-than, less-than, or equality; equality"
#~ " uses a fixed $10^{-4}$ Å tolerance. "
#~ "Replacement weights are normalized to probabilities"
#~ " $p_e$. `Exact` mode uses the largest-"
#~ "remainder method to determine integer counts "
#~ "for $|\\mathcal I|$ sites; `Random` mode "
#~ "samples each site independently from $P(Z_i=e)=p_e$."
#~ " The former controls counts within one "
#~ "structure, while the latter allows composition "
#~ "fluctuations between structures."

#~ msgid "场景：模型在表面化学上完全失效，但体相预测很好"
