#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出 = 输入，没有替换。** `目标元素`（`target`）为空，或输入结构中不存在该元素，或 "
#~ "`位置筛选`（`condition`）把所有候选位点都过滤掉了。先用 `condition=all` 验证替换逻辑，再逐步收紧条件。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output = input, with no replacement.** "
#~ "`Target element` (`target`) is empty, the "
#~ "input contains no such element, or `Position"
#~ " filter` (`condition`) removed every candidate "
#~ "site. First verify the replacement logic with"
#~ " `condition=all`, then tighten the condition "
#~ "gradually."

#~ msgid "**替换了不该替换的位点。** condition 表达式区域范围写错了。检查结构坐标范围，确认上下限对应目标区域。Slab 的真空层可能导致 z 坐标超出预期。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Unexpected sites were replaced.** Inspect the "
#~ "structure's coordinate range and correct the "
#~ "condition bounds. Vacuum in a slab can "
#~ "make z limits unintuitive."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**condition 解析失败。** 检查变量是否只用了 x/y/z，并确认没有 "
#~ "`===`、函数调用等不支持的语法。`=`、`==`、`>=`、`<=`、`!=` 都是合法写法；非法表达式会明确抛出 "
#~ "`ValueError`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The condition could not be parsed.** Check"
#~ " that it uses only x/y/z variables and "
#~ "does not contain unsupported syntax such as"
#~ " `===` or function calls. `=`, `==`, `>=`,"
#~ " `<=`, and `!=` are all valid. An "
#~ "invalid expression raises `ValueError` explicitly."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**随机模式为什么没有保留一部分原元素？** 这里的“随机”只表示在多个替换元素之间逐位随机分配，不表示随机决定是否替换。要控制替换数量或浓度，请使用"
#~ " `Random Doping`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Why does random mode not retain some "
#~ "original elements?** Here, `random` means only "
#~ "that replacement elements are assigned randomly "
#~ "site by site; it does not randomly "
#~ "decide whether to replace a site. To "
#~ "control the replacement count or concentration, "
#~ "use `Random Doping`."

#~ msgid "**替换后键长不合理。** 纯化学替换不做结构弛豫。如果键长明显异常，建议后接弛豫计算。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Bond lengths are unreasonable after replacement.**"
#~ " This operation changes species without "
#~ "relaxation. Relax the structure before treating "
#~ "it as a physical configuration."

